---
title: "Flow 1 — Student Enrollment (implemented: enrollment-service, notification-service; live push is Server-Sent Events from notification-service)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant Client as Angular SPA
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant IAM as Identity and Access
    participant ACAD as Academic Structure
    participant ENR as Enrollment
    participant MQ as Message Broker
    participant NOTIF as Notification
    participant WS as Live push (SSE, notification-service)

    Student->>Client: Click "Enroll" on COSC5105
    Client->>GW: POST /courses/COSC5105/enrollments (JWT)
    GW->>IAM: validate token
    IAM-->>GW: valid, role = Student
    GW->>ENR: forward enroll request

    ENR->>ACAD: GET course COSC5105 (open? seats left?)
    ACAD-->>ENR: open, 8 seats remaining

    alt seats available
        ENR->>ENR: lock row, insert CourseEnrollment, decrement capacity
        ENR-->>GW: 201 Created
        GW-->>Client: Enrolled successfully
        Client-->>Student: "Enrolled in COSC5105"
        ENR-)MQ: publish StudentEnrolled (async, fire-and-forget)
        MQ-)NOTIF: consume StudentEnrolled
        NOTIF->>NOTIF: send confirmation email + in-app notification
        MQ-)WS: consume StudentEnrolled
        WS--)Client: live push "You're enrolled"
    else course full
        ENR-->>GW: 409 Conflict (no seats)
        GW-->>Client: Enrollment failed
        Client-->>Student: "Course is full — join waitlist?"
        Note over ENR,MQ: No event published — nothing happened, so nothing to notify
    end
